<decision #track.remove_detached_orm_relation_annotations.authority_cut {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = false
}
(
  <question ?>Should Kunun retain a deprecated detached ORM relation parser?</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>No; the mission requires Property metadata to be the only ORM relation authority.</?>
    <decision-text ?>Remove the parser, exports, tests, and generated artifacts without a compatibility reader.</?>
    <rationale ?>The controlled consumers have migrated, and retaining a positive parser would preserve dual authority.</?>
    <evidence ?>Mission-level fresh verification found the exported parser and positive tests after host migration completed.</?>
  )
  >
)>
